From: PlezyNG
Subject: [PATCH] Android ANVIL: run LiteRT through slot-indexed async worker

Adds double-buffered float LiteRT inputs and outputs to the existing Android ANVIL worker. Vulkan preprocessing can fill the free slot while a provider inference is running; inference jobs retain explicit buffer ownership. The CPU fallback remains synchronous.

